here the point is the other one \cref{sec:git-environment} makes: the
index Git writes must be one this module chose, and saying so in every
place that stages leaves no path where the answer comes from
somewhere else.
There is nothing to seed it from---this is the first index this
repository has---so it is built from scratch and then published as the
shared one, which is what leaves the stat cache warm for the first run.

