The two tests below pin the halves of the review semantics that live
in this module rather than in the recorder.

The first is the header side: playback begins by snapshotting the work
tree, so whatever the student changed since their last run is part of
the state they sat down to review.  Without that, a review of code
edited an hour ago would be recorded against an hour-old snapshot.

